{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把‘当初那些气不该忍’说成‘坚持自己没有错’，将不愿再忍受委屈的立场偏成证明自己没有错，两者并不完全相同。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把‘舍不得被当作自己人的日子’说成‘怀念那些人’，将留恋的重点从被接纳的关系体验稍微偏向了具体的人。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把‘光凭舍不得，还是没法放心回去’解释成‘不相信回去就是正确选择’，将缺乏安全感和踏实感偏成了对回去是否正确的判断。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"从离开后的怀念、委屈与孤独，到反复摇摆、重新接纳过去的美好与伤害，最终带着想念继续生活、不再为了陪伴委屈自己，整体故事与完整稿是一回事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a3fc389d-720c-4d4d-abae-074f57685295", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T144503170344Z", "elapsed_seconds": 83.734, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T14:46:26.920750+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": t